    "long_instructions": "## Chat with ELIZA\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\nWork with your partner to compare ELIZA and AI Tutor.\r\n\r\n1. Choose one prompt to try in both tools.\r\n\r\n2. Type the prompt into ELIZA. Your partner will type the same prompt into AI Tutor.\r\n\r\n3. Record ELIZA’s response in your activity guide.\r\n\r\n4. Try one follow-up prompt and record ELIZA’s response.\r\n\r\nAs you chat, notice when ELIZA seems intelligent and when it breaks down.\r\n\r\n::: details [ELIZA implementation credit]\r\nNorbert Landsteiner — ELIZA JavaScript implementation\r\n:::",
